# tools/drey_witness.rish — the whole Mikrophone firmware journey, proven in one command (mikrophone–mikrophone).
#
# Chapter A (Hardware & Right-to-Repair) · waymark mikrophone · Mikrophone firmware journey · aggregate witness.
# Front door: mikrophone/README.md.
#
# The Mikrophone firmware journey grew from one crux — a session that forgets — to eleven proven rungs: the memory that
# forgets, the wire that carries only the committed, the record button, the whole loop, the far side's verify-before-keep
# discipline, the carry meeting, the bounded archive, the content-addressed catalog, the manifest of holdings, the
# want-response that closes a local content-addressed sync, and the redaction that lets a keeper forget one span on
# purpose. Each rung has its own witness; this one runs all eleven in rung order and asserts each GREEN, so the whole
# journey proves from cold in a single command — the reference weave the front door names.
#
# Run from the repository root:
#   rishi/bin/rishi run tools/drey_witness.rish

say "drey: Language EN — the whole Mikrophone firmware journey (mikrophone–mikrophone), each rung's witness run in order and asserted GREEN in one command."
say "drey: Style Radiant — a device that forgets on purpose, proven whole: a capture held only while powered, kept only on a deliberate commit, redacted where a keeper strikes it, carried only when committed, and received only once proven — no byte crossing that a keeper did not need, none kept that cannot be proven."
say "drey: Lens TAME — every rung is pure Rye on the bench, bounded, invariant-asserted, refusing by name; no disk, no network, no key, no funds. Serving over a real transport stays the Comlink-served gate; real hardware stays custody gate %2."

let session = run ["rishi/bin/rishi" "run" "tools/drey_session_witness.rish"]
assert session.ok else "drey: mikrophone session witness failed"
assert (session.out contains "GREEN drey-session") else "drey: mikrophone session not GREEN"

let wire = run ["rishi/bin/rishi" "run" "tools/drey_wire_witness.rish"]
